+/*
+ * Pure UEFI boot: the autoboot menu's first entry - and therefore the
+ * timeout default - runs the full EFI boot manager, which honours BootNext
+ * and then walks BootOrder, both managed out-of-band by the BMC in the I2C
+ * variable store. The menu also lists every Boot#### option individually
+ * (selecting one sets a volatile BootNext) plus the eficonfig maintenance
+ * menu. 'bootcmd' runs the same command for non-menu paths ('boot' at the
+ * console).
+ */
