+	 * compatible strings instead of ofnode_read_pci_vendev() because
+	 * firmware DTBs may use short device IDs (e.g. "pci1de4,1"
+	 * instead of "pci1de4,0001") which ofnode_read_pci_vendev()
+	 * cannot parse.
